{"parse": {"title": "3RD-10", "pageid": 6077, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-09\" title=\"3RD-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">3RD-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-11\" title=\"3RD-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">3RD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.95.8A.EF.BC.8C.E8.88.B9.E9.95.BF.EF.BC.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"啊，船长！\">啊，船长！</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 啊，船长！</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">O Captain!</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>天<span class=\"color-value\"></span>啊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>未<span class=\"color-value\"></span>做<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>样<span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>胆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>未<span class=\"color-value\"></span>感<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>理<span class=\"color-value\"></span>解<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10310</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin_ye\"><img alt=\"senlin_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/600px-Cg-senlin_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/900px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/1200px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沿着乔治橡树灰褐色的枝干向下望去，一个膨胀的，黝黑的树洞，与凹陷的土地接壤，构建出了天然的堡垒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乔治橡树生长于七百年前，它以一个长辈的身份，迎送了每一年学校的巡礼演出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>树洞里常年居住着红松鼠和啄木鸟，巨大的空间令“圈环”踢橡果的声音都带着特殊回响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>——你说会有人来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>会不会，等到最后，都没有一个人过来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他焦灼地踱步，将橡果踢得满地都是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>说不定根本没有人在乎外面的事情，大家都对学校的教导很满意……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我猜至少能来两个同学吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>伊莎贝拉……她刚进校的时候，一直哭着想回家。也许她会来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这种事情很难打包票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……只要来的不是教员就好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>维尔汀！你看外面——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一两个微弱得像萤火一样的光芒出现在远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧接着，是更多，更多的光点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们像散落在夜空中的星星，安静地前行，最后，汇成一条驶向这里的星河。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>是他们——！天啊，他们、还有她们全都来了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>怎么会有这么多人？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那些都是熟悉的面孔。太阳正当空的时候，熟悉且沉默的面孔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>竟然……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>小梅斯梅尔、伊莎贝拉、“便士”、玛蒂尔达……你们都来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>加上“圈环”的同学，这里几乎钻进了半个班的学生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们陆续地跳进来，巨大的树洞一下变得很拥挤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生众：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等所有人都安顿好后，气氛变得紧张起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们面面相觑。这个集会是——应被严厉禁止的、违反道德而且邪恶的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个漫长的沉默过后，终于有人开始提问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>——维尔汀……你把我们都喊到这里来，是想要反抗校长吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>什么……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>当然不是。我从来没想过！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>呼……那我就放心了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>吓死我了。小梅斯梅尔你可真敢问！不过我也松了一口气……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅱ：</div><div>要是造反的话我第一个就跑！我可没想要和谁作对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群里传来了此起彼伏的笑声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>那你想做什么呢？我们……我们都是偷偷跑出来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我没想到会有这么多人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>学校里居然会有这么多人，和我与“圈环”一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>都想要知道更多外面的事情……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>最近那些传言……大家应该都听说了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>但我们不仅被禁止提到“那个词”，还被禁止提到所有与外界有关的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们的生活，只能围绕着训练、和平、人类，这三个东西转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>明明我们有不一样的发色、说着不一样的口音、使用着不一样的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但《学生守则》却要求我们忘记这一切，要我们磨平棱角，成为整齐划一的模范。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>我们捡到了一些宣传单，上面记录了很多外面的诗歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>是我们课本上从来没有学过的东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那首诗歌让我想到了很多东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们是被选中的孩子。我们注定要成为第一防线的砥柱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但是今天站在这里的同学，一定对自己尚未被磨平的棱角，对外面的世界还抱有着好奇吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们无法离开学校，但我们能有另一种方式来了解真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>各位同学们，在入学之前……你曾过着怎么样的生活？住在什么样的地方？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那里的人也念咒语吗？他们也像我们一样，喜欢吃司康饼吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>通过这些来自世界各地的回忆，我们一定能在这里“复原”出外面世界真实的模样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生众：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>原来还有这样的方法……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>这是我们想到的最安全的办法了。毕竟我们也不可能离开这里——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅱ：</div><div>我、我这里藏了一些捡到的传单！还有离开了的教员送给我的彩色玻璃球！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅱ：</div><div>这些也算是外面的世界的东西吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>都别吵了，都别吵了！让我玛蒂尔达第一个来发言！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我叫玛蒂尔达·布翁尼！我是本校年龄最大的转校生，是被特别批准进来的！所以呀，关于外面的事情，我比你们每个人都要清楚得多……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>我、我是伊莎贝拉，我4岁就被接进来了，所以我记得的不多……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>嗯，我记得院长妈妈喜欢穿灰蓝色的花裙子，还有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>我们那边很少下雨，天像圆形的盖子，上面没有云……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我们家是神秘学界的心理学世家。“动物磁性”是我的祖父的祖父的……发明的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不过我不是很喜欢神秘学家，他们都容易发疯，最后还是要让我们去治疗——看起来很吓人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>对了，我家那边有个很大的足球训练场，草皮总是光秃秃的。球门上还生锈了——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin_ye\"><img alt=\"senlin_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/600px-Cg-senlin_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/900px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/1200px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>说慢一点，说慢一点！足球是什么？球门又是什么？我记不过来了……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“圈环”在记录着这些回忆。小册子上密密麻麻的，累成了好几页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每个人都被激起了怀旧、温暖、甚至是团结的情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们从未感受到如此的融为一体。他们不同的过去，与现在汇成了如今的彼此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>……这首诗写得真好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊莎贝拉拿着那张宣传单，窃窃私语道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>我都想把它唱出来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊莎贝拉突然站起身来，把大家都吓了一跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>你要唱歌？怎么唱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>用我们校歌的旋律！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>你看，这个拍子刚好能对的上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>欢欣，平安，或是声名，康健，又及敬佩与尊严，技巧同孔武……♪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>——我的天，还真的对上了？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>都不关照顺意而又盲从的牧群……♪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>启明的星，闪烁不见他们双眼……♪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大家都纷纷站起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅱ：</div><div>天啊，一字不落地对上了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-507310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-507310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-507310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这难道是命运给我们的指示吗？它是要我们、它是要我们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>它是要我们在巡礼演出上唱出来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-507401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-507401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-507401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>怎么可能，我们一定会被抓的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-506301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-506301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-506301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>——但校长他们，就能听到我们的心声了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-506301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-506301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-506301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“圈环”：</div><div>他们就会知道，我们……我们也有自己的想法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-507101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊莎贝拉：</div><div>他们会理解我们的，对吗？维尔汀，他们可是看着我们长大的呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他们也许会不高兴，会批评我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但是，让我们试试吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这片黑暗中，大家的手默默地牵在了一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这首歌……分明比之前的更动听啊。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "3RD-10"}}